INSAPOS v2.2e: New logo, role-gated readings, rewards scan, fix recent txns

- New INSA POS app icon applied to all 3 Android apps (INSABuddy, INSAPOS, INSAPOSv2)
- X-Reading/Z-Reading buttons now only visible for owner/admin/manager roles
- Fixed Recent Transactions: wrong column name (grand_total -> total), added error handling
- Added customer rewards scan (DIY Biz Rewards) icon in header with modal for QR/barcode/card lookup
- Product QR/barcode scan button now works independently of INSABuddy (also via INSAPOSv2 native bridge)
- Added /api/pos/customer/quick-lookup endpoint with auto-type detection
- Fixed customer search in cart to use the correct API endpoint
- Bumped INSAPOSv2 to v2.2e (versionCode 5), updated GHA artifact names
